{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/5149b9a8f90daea0e8456cf54ccd07af.poster.avif?t=1761835736\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/5149b9a8f90daea0e8456cf54ccd07af.webm?t=1761835736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Monster Chef</strong>, your kitchen is the battlefield! Play as <strong>Pranzo</strong>, a chef-warrior who hunts monsters and cooks them on the spot using their Chef Weapons. In this roguelite hack-and-slash, battle cute but fierce enemies, explore a <strong>procedurally generated world</strong>, and <strong>build your outstanding inn</strong>. Expand your culinary skills and discover tasty recipes! Sharpen your blade, fire up your salt shaker, dinner is served!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Monsters into Tasty Dishes</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f809e8aa525dba7489fb5256407bedf0.poster.avif?t=1761835736\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f809e8aa525dba7489fb5256407bedf0.webm?t=1761835736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, fight and cook monsters right on the battlefield using your Chef Weapons. Season them with Spices in real-time combat and create gourmet dishes with a fast-paced hack &amp; slash system that blends intense action and high-level cuisine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage and Rebuild your Inn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/d1f8e3c13b8458883e2749e0f2afe7d1.poster.avif?t=1761835736\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/d1f8e3c13b8458883e2749e0f2afe7d1.webm?t=1761835736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the daily order and serve a diverse clientele of fantasy tribes\u2014elves, orcs, merfolk, and humans\u2014each with unique tastes and requests. Upgrade your inn with stunning furniture and transform it from a humble shack into a prestigious five-star tavern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Colorful Hand-Drawn World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f31490d0fe574fdbc60701e8d1abfd68.poster.avif?t=1761835736\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/f31490d0fe574fdbc60701e8d1abfd68.webm?t=1761835736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever-changing lands of Delizia, an open world with a procedurally generated map, where every day brings a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover a Deep Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/477bf9e011169afc8cbdd8ff33d554fa.poster.avif?t=1761835736\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/477bf9e011169afc8cbdd8ff33d554fa.webm?t=1761835736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impress the rulers of Delizia by preparing grand feasts from the giant bosses you defeat. Unlock new biomes, each teeming with fresh monsters and challenges. Meet a diverse cast of characters, each with their own unique story and personality. Build friendships, offer help when you can, and uncover hidden secrets through exclusive dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/818910a408e85e4fba7cdfaa24d788d8.poster.avif?t=1761835736\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/extras/818910a408e85e4fba7cdfaa24d788d8.webm?t=1761835736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3063720?t=1761835736","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/31887b46d47f4d96753c63b3fcd8dc3650096ec6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761835736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/f2102b69c61dd895c96f315d23c34a605a8f95b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761835736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063720/f2102b69c61dd895c96f315d23c34a605a8f95b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761835736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3721600,"de